#: ../../integration_guides/Backups/zerto.rst:7
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../integration_guides/Backups/zerto.rst:9
msgid ""
"By integrating |morpheus| and Zerto, |morpheus| will automatically bring in "
"your pre-existing Zerto replication groups as well as allow you to create "
"and edit replication groups from within |morpheus| UI. Additionally, the "
"Zerto integration can be set as the replication provider to existing "
"compatible Clouds (such as VMware vCenter Clouds) to allow new workloads to "
"be added to replication groups. If needed, new replication groups can also "
"be created at provision time with the newly provisioned VMs added to them. "
"The Zerto integration detail page also provides summary details for the "
"integration as well as listing out replications and replication sites which "
"are available to use with replication groups."
msgstr ""
"By integrating |morpheus| y Zerto, |morpheus| será automáticamente bring in "
"your pre-existente Zerto replication groups así como allow you to create y "
"edit replication groups desde dentro de |morpheus| UI. Adicionalmente, el "
"Zerto integration se puede establecer as el replication proveedor to "
"existente compatible Clouds (como VMware vCenter Clouds) to allow nuevo "
"workloads to be agregado to replication groups. If needed, nuevo replication"
" groups puede también be creado at provision time con el newly provisioned "
"VMs agregado to them. The Zerto integration página de detalles también "
"provides resumen detalles para la integración así como listing out "
"replications y replication sites cual son disponible to use con replication "
"groups."

